<!-- ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ ¶ -->


<!--CRAFT WEAPONS. CATEGORY MENU! Please make sure to add ANY AND ALL CHANGES /ADDITIONS TO THIS MENU to the Forgemaster NPC's craft menu as well.-->

	<!--\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
	CRAFT WEAPONS
	NOTE: LATER, CHANGE THESE TO 'craft (weapon type)' and then have the
	choice required be a weapon list (such as a list of beams used as components) instead!
	\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\-->
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD">
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON">
		<text>Select a weapon category to forge.</text>
		<checkCargo/>
		
		<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Nevermind.</text>
			<event load="FORGEMASTER_PHONE_EVENT_LOAD"/>
		</choice>
		<!--LASERS CATEGORY-->
		<choice req="FM_LASER_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="1" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Laser Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LASER_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_LASER_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="1" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Laser Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LASER_LOAD"/>
		</choice>


		<!--ION/ENERGY CATEGORY-->
		<choice req="FM_ION_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="2" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Ion Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ION_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_ION_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="2" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Ion Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ION_LOAD"/>
		</choice>




		<!--BEAM CATEGORY-->
		<choice req="FM_BEAM_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="3" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Beam Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_BEAM_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_BEAM_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="3" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Beam Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_BEAM_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<!--Pinpoint CATEGORY-->
		<choice req="FM_PINPOINT_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="4" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Pinpoint Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_PINPOINT_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_PINPOINT_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="4" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Pinpoint Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_PINPOINT_LOAD"/>
		</choice>


		<!--FLAK CATEGORY-->
		<choice req="FM_FLAK_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="5" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Flak Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_FLAK_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_FLAK_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="5" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Flak Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_FLAK_LOAD"/>
		</choice>



		<!--EXPLOSIVE CATEGORY-->

		<choice req="FM_EXPLOSIVE_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="6" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Explosive Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_EXPLOSIVES_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_EXPLOSIVE_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="6" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Explosive Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_EXPLOSIVES_LOAD"/>
		</choice>



		<!--ORGANIC CATEGORY-->


		<choice req="FM_ORGANIC_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="7" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Organic Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ORGANIC_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_ORGANIC_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="7" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Organic Weapons.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ORGANIC_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_SHOTGUN_BRONZE_LIST_UPGRADE" lvl="1" max_group="8" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Upgrade List</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_UPGRADE_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_SHOTGUN_BRONZE_LIST_UPGRADE" lvl="0" max_group="8" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Upgrade List</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_UPGRADE_LOAD"/>
		</choice>
		<!--COMBAT DRONE CATEGORY-->
		<choice req="FM_COMBAT_DRONE_FORGE_LIST" lvl="1" max_group="9" hidden="true">
			<text>Review Combat Drone List</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_COMBAT_DRONE_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="FM_COMBAT_DRONE_FORGE_LIST" lvl="0" max_group="9" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Review Combat Drone List</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_COMBAT_DRONE_LOAD"/>
		</choice>
	</event>



	<!--CRAFT WEAPONS. STORAGE CRAFT WEAPON LIST
	\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
	CRAFT WEAPONS
	NOTE: LATER, CHANGE THESE TO 'craft (weapon type)' and then have the
	choice required be a weapon list (such as a list of beams used as components) instead!
	\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\-->

	<!--LASERS CRAFT CATEGORY-->
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LASER_LOAD">	<!--LASERS CRAFT CATEGORY-->
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LASER</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LASER">

		<text>Which weapon would you like to craft?</text>
		<checkCargo/>
		<!--Back to main craft menu-->
		<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" blue="false">
			<text>Nevermind, back to main menu.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Install an Irradiation Laser core in a Frost I chassis to forge the 'TLALOC' Anomaly Laser. [Cost: 40~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_LASER_ANOMALY_1"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Replace the barrels of a Vulcan with a Fire-Starter's heat sinks to forge the 'Hellflash' Gatling Gun. [Cost: 30~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_CHAINGUN_FIRE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Use a gaseous form for fuel and ignite it with the Fire-Starter to forge the Dazhbog Flamethrower. [Cost: 50~].</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FLAMETHROWER"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Dissolve a Lanius in a Phaser II's energy field to forge the 'Decayser'. [Cost: 55~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_PHASER_SUFFOCATION"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Use a Particle Accelerator I and Light Laser I to forge the Photon Laser I. [Cost: 25~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_LASER_PHOTON"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Use a Particle Accelerator II and Light Laser II to forge the Photon Laser II. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_LASER_PHOTON_2"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Install an Irradiation Laser core in a Heavy I chassis to forge the 'Rebel Ripper' Laser. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_LASER_HUMAN"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Forge the Absolution with Ion Bomb teleportation tech, the core of a Piercing Laser II, and a hefty amount of scrap. [Cost: 100~, 15}]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_LASER_ION_MEGA"/>
		</choice>
		
		<choice>
			<text>Jack a Flak 4's power core into a Burst Laser III. [Cost: 80~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_SURGE_LASER"/>
		</choice>

		<choice req="GATLING_ANCIENT" lvl="1" blue="true" hidden="true">
			<text>Have Alastair tweak the Godkiller. [Cost: 10~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_GODKILLER"/>
		</choice>
	</event>




	<!--ION/ENERGY CRAFT CATEGORY-->
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ION_LOAD">	<!--ION/ENERGY CRAFT CATEGORY-->
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ION</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_ION">
		<text>Which weapon would you like to craft?</text>
		<checkCargo/>

		<!--Back to main craft menu-->
		<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" blue="false">
			<text>Nevermind, back to main menu.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Load scrap into a basic minelauncher and energize it with a Hullbuster Energy weapon to forge the TARANIS Energized Disc. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_ENERGY_DISC"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Tri-ion and Fire Ion to forge the 'Cerberus' Ion. [Cost: 35~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_ION_TRI_FIRE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Replace the barrels of a Vulcan with a Charge Ion's energized coils to forge the 'Vesta' Gatling Ion. [Cost: 30-60~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_CHAINGUN_ION"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Flak III and Energy Charger to forge the 'Exidia' Energy Diffuser. [Cost: 80~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_SHOTGUN_ENERGY"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Burst Laser I and Energy I to forge the Pulse Laser I. [Cost: 40~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_PULSE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Burst Laser II and Energy II to forge the Pulse Laser II. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_PULSE_2"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Burst Laser III and Energy III to forge the Pulse Laser III. [Cost: 60~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_PULSE_3"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Heavy Energy and Heavy Ion to forge the Pulsedeep Cannon. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_PULSEDEEP"/>
		</choice>
	</event>


	<!--BEAM/Pinpoint CRAFT CATEGORY-->
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_BEAM_LOAD">	<!--BEAMCRAFT CATEGORY-->
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON_BEAM</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_BEAM">
		<text>Which weapon would you like to craft?</text>
		<checkCargo/>

		<choice>
			<text>Nevermind.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Dissassemble and combine a 'Sarissa' Beam and Mining beam to forge the Ishimura Beam. [Cost: 120~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_MINING_2"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Install Particle Beam technology in a Guisarme's frame to forge the 'Earspoon' Beam. [Cost: 35~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_PARTICLE_PIERCE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Provide some Murder-Bots a Fauchard and some scrap to reconfigure to their hearts' content. [Cost: 110~, 2}, 5|]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_GUILLOTINE_CHAIN"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Rewire a Halberd beam to use its length as a teleportation lock-on for Small Bombs to forge the 'Valefor' beam. [Cost: 75~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_EXPLOSION"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a 'Ranseur' with a Basic Ion or Ion Barrage Mark I to forge this weapon. [Cost: 60-100~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_ION_PIERCE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a 'Pike' beam and a 'Scythe' beam to forge the 'Eternity' Beam. [Cost: 40~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_ETERNITY"/>
		</choice>
		
		<choice>
			<text>[CNC + AA] Combine a Prism Cannon and Prismatic Ion Barrage to forge the Prismatic Scatter Beam. [Cost: 60~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_BEAM_PRISM_SCATTER"/>
		</choice>
	</event>


	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_PINPOINT_LOAD">	<!--BEAM/Pinpoint CRAFT CATEGORY-->
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON_PINPOINT</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_PINPOINT">
		<text>Which weapon would you like to craft?</text>
		<checkCargo/>

		<choice req="pilot" lvl="1"  blue="false">
			<text>Nevermind.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD"/>
		</choice>


		<choice>
			<text>Finagle a Cinquedea Pinpoint into a Hermes missile shell to forge the 'Parazonium' Pinpoint. [Cost: 70~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_FUELED_1"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Replace Dirk's power source with an Energy I core to forge the 'Ebony' Pinpoint. [Cost: 40~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_ENERGY_1"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Replace the Misericorde's power source with an Energy II core to forge the 'Hemlock' Pinpoint. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_ENERGY_2"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Replace a Stiletto's power source with an Energy III core to forge the 'Greenheart' Pinpoint. [Cost: 60~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_ENERGY_3"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Replace Dirk's power source with a Conservative Energy core to forge the 'Maple' Pinpoint. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_ENERGY_CONS"/>
		</choice>
			
		<choice>
			<text>Enhance the Anelace's focusing lens with a Corrosive Laser II's deadly chemicals. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_VIRUS"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Suyari beam and Cinquedea pinpoint to forge the Omiyari focus. [Cost: 50~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_FOCUS_ADAPT"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Misericorde or Stiletto and Ishimura Beam to forge the Terra Nova 'ShipCracker'. [Cost: 50-70~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BEAM_MINING_3"/>
		</choice>
	</event>


	<!--FLAK CRAFT CATEGORY-->
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_FLAK_LOAD">	<!--FLAK CRAFT CATEGORY-->
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON_FLAK</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_FLAK">
		<text>Which weapon would you like to craft?</text>
		<checkCargo/>

		<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" hidden="true" blue="false">
			<text>Nevermind.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD"/>
		</choice>
		<choice>
			<text>Install the Frost II cooling module in the Irradiated Flak chassis to forge the 'KHEIMON' Anomaly Dispenser. [Cost: 45~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_SHOTGUN_ANOMALY"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Infuse your Flak II with crystalline growths to forge the Bronze Flak. [Cost: 10~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_SHOTGUN_BRONZE_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Install a remnant of technology once lost, to upgrade a Flak IV. [Cost: 60~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_SHOTGUN_AETHER"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Install Lanius tech into your Flak weapon. [Cost: 30~]

				You need a level 3 clonebay, a Lanius, and a Flak II to craft the Carnifex Flak.</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_SHOTGUN_CURSED"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Combine a Charge Flak and Charge Energy to forge the Railblender. [140~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_ENERGY_RAILBLENDER"/>
		</choice>
	</event>



	<!--EXPLOSIVE CRAFT CATEGORY-->
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_EXPLOSIVES_LOAD">	<!--EXPLOSIVE CRAFT CATEGORY-->
		<loadEvent>FM_FORGE_WEAPON_EXPLOSIVES</loadEvent>
	</event>
	<event name="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_EXPLOSIVES">
		<text>Which weapon would you like to craft?</text>
		<checkCargo/>

		<!--Back to main craft menu-->
		<choice req="pilot" lvl="1" blue="false">
			<text>Nevermind, back to main menu.</text>
			<event load="FM_FORGE_WEAPON_LOAD"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Dissassemble and combine two Ares and Hades missiles to forge the 'Hellfire' Burst Missile. [Cost: 90~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_MISSILES_BURST_FIRE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Upgrade the Nyx missile's cloaking field with an Energy Stunner core to forge the 'Chernobog' Missile. [Cost: 70~]</text>
