		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Infuse a Lockdown Bomb's crystals with a Fire Bomb to forge Project #7:Burning End. [Cost: 60~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BOMB_CRYSTAL_FIRE"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Infuse a Lockdown Bomb's crystals with an Irradiation Bomb to forge Project #22: Unnamed. [Cost: 80~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BOMB_CRYSTAL_BIO"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Jury-Rig the power core of a Hull Laser II into a Sobek Mine launcher to forge this weapon. [Cost: 90~]</text>
			<event load="NPC_STORAGE_CHECK_CREATE_FM_BOMBLAUNCHER_HULL"/>
		</choice>

		<choice>
			<text>Tear the core out of an Ascelpius missile and fit it in an Osiris launcher. [Cost: 140~]</text>
